{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"edits\": [],\n  \"note\": \"逐项核对后，不建议补写。当前稿与别版r79d只有S04存在实质文字差异，而且当前稿在这里增加了真正有价值的心理联系：亲近记忆越鲜活，当初受过的委屈越容易重新浮现。这既交代了怀念如何重新牵动对离开决定的怀疑，也让维护尊严与渴望归属在同一刻发生冲突。别版“一切还能照从前那样继续”的愿望范围虽稍宽，但当前稿“还能那样相处”已经保留其核心意思，没有丢失独立的心理事实。珠子中其他段落的寒意、梦境破裂、声音失重、祈祷转为意志等听感，也没有发现当前稿遗漏且必须补回的唯一心理落脚点：相关转折已经分别落在突然的不安、反复怀疑、害怕独自承担、带着恐惧继续向前等条目中。其他听感描述多属于可并存的音乐联想，不宜为了覆盖它们而给人物增加心理动作或重复解释。尤其保留S12-2和S13-4的最终态度与选择，不削弱带着想念继续生活、拒绝再为留住谁而忍受委屈的落点。当前稿已经保住了有价值的内容，也没有值得用额外文字换回来的实质损失，因此不作修改。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8767a04a-2be9-48ac-9d6e-0b390b01f52b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T192516298017Z", "elapsed_seconds": 89.937, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T19:26:46.267965+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1576f31f316630590e1a7f4e8b377bf5c079f7883bdbe7d63e82c0580b46fe31", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "t